a man is humiliated in the street by a  police officer  this shepherd is being reprimanded and  pushed apparently because his sheep got  too close to the local government  headquarters  [Music]  the video has led to protests that also  include the state of the economy  joblessness and police violence they  came a decade after a street vendor set  himself on fire in protest over the same  issues  an event that became a catalyst for the  2011 revolution in tunisia and the arab  spring  earlier in the day prime minister hisham  mishishi had reshuffled the cabinet  adding 12 new ministers to carry out  reforms including new ministers of  health  interior justice and energy  the aim of this reshuffle is to achieve  greater efficiency in the work of the  government's policy and plans  many view the timing as important  thursday was the anniversary of the  downfall of president xena abedin  benally who was forced out in a popular  revolution that swept the region  but with demonstrations banned because  of the coronavirus there were no  commemorations on the streets  but in at least six cities protesters  defied those orders  in confrontations with police officers  protesters across the country  once again being heard in the capitol  andrew chappelle al jazeera
 

